# GTA V (sim/scripts/start_gta_sitl.sh appends this to its SITL overrides in pose and physics
# mode). ArduPilot holds the operating area: 40 m around home (Legion Square and its edges) and
# the urban profile's 48 m ceiling, with RTL (or LAND) on a breach.
# The 6 m floor (FENCE_TYPE bit 8) keeps flight above the 4.4 m kiosk roof and the unmapped low
# objects (config/horus_gta.yaml). Copter 4.7.1 arms it only once the vehicle first climbs above
# FENCE_ALT_MIN ("Min Alt fence enabled (auto enable)") and disarms it when LAND or RTL starts
# ("Min Alt fence auto-disabled"), so take-off from the ground, LAND and RTL still work: checked
# on SITL with a 10 m take-off followed by LAND and by RTL.
FENCE_ENABLE 1
FENCE_TYPE 11
FENCE_ACTION 1
FENCE_MARGIN 2
FENCE_RADIUS 40
FENCE_ALT_MAX 48
FENCE_ALT_MIN 6
